{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55269","headline":"送进士董位 · 龚霖","name":"送进士董位","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送君偏起恨，醲酒亦难消。\n爲客日己久，还家路各遥。\n云繁天欲雪，林迥野初烧。\n何处期相见，春风满路招。\n（同前第四三三七页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"龚霖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}